## Symptom

Clients receive `504 Gateway Time-out` on complex analytical or reporting endpoints. NGINX error log shows `upstream timed out (110: Connection timed out)`.

## Root Cause

Upstream API handler execution duration exceeds NGINX `proxy_read_timeout` (default 60s).

## Resolution

Increase NGINX proxy timeout for long-running report locations:

```nginx
location /api/v1/reports/ {
    proxy_read_timeout 300s;
    proxy_connect_timeout 75s;
    proxy_send_timeout 300s;
    proxy_pass http://api_backend;
}
```
Reload NGINX:
```bash
nginx -s reload
```
